  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#VoltageAngleLimit">
    <cims:belongsToCategory rdf:resource="https://ap-voc.cim4.eu/StateInstructionSchedule#StateInstructionScheduleProfile"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Voltage angle limit between two terminals. The association end OperationalLimitSet.Terminal defines one end and the host of the limit. The association end VoltageAngleLimit.AngleReferenceTerminal defines the reference terminal.</rdfs:comment>
