    <rdfs:comment>Assessed element regular time point which belong to an assessed element regular schedule.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularSchedule"/>
    <cims:inverseRoleName rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint.AssessedElementRegularSchedule"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">AssessedElementRegularTimePoint</rdfs:label>
    <cims:multiplicity rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/1999/rdf-schema-extensions-19990926#M:0..n"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint"/>
    <cims:stereotype>NC</cims:stereotype>
    <cims:stereotype rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/NonStandard/UML#ofAggregate"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint.AssessedElementRegularSchedule">
    <cims:AssociationUsed>Yes</cims:AssociationUsed>
    <rdfs:comment>Assessed element regular schedule which has assessed element regular time points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint"/>
    <cims:inverseRoleName rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularSchedule.AssessedElementRegularTimePoint"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">AssessedElementRegularSchedule</rdfs:label>
    <cims:multiplicity rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/1999/rdf-schema-extensions-19990926#M:0..1"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularSchedule"/>
    <cims:stereotype>NC</cims:stereotype>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint.appointedMargin">
    <rdfs:comment>The percentage (appointed to a region) of the remaining margin obtained in the grid model to reach its current limit. The maximum percentage shall by default be 10% of the remaining margin.
It is only used when an assessed element is considered conservative for a region.
The allowed value range is [0,100].</rdfs:comment>
    <cims:dataType rdf:resource="#PerCent"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">appointedMargin</rdfs:label>
    <cims:multiplicity rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/1999/rdf-schema-extensions-19990926#M:0..1"/>
    <cims:stereotype rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/NonStandard/UML#attribute"/>
    <cims:stereotype>NC</cims:stereotype>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint.enabled">
    <rdfs:comment>It identifies if the assessed element is enabled. True means enabled, False means disabled.</rdfs:comment>
    <cims:dataType rdf:resource="#Boolean"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">enabled</rdfs:label>
    <cims:multiplicity rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/1999/rdf-schema-extensions-19990926#M:0..1"/>
    <cims:stereotype rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/NonStandard/UML#attribute"/>
    <cims:stereotype>NC</cims:stereotype>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint.maxFlow">
    <rdfs:comment>Maximum flow on an a conducting equipment or a collection of conducting equipment forming a power transfer corridor. For assessed elements that is becomes critical due to contingency, this value represents the maximum flow with remedial action taken into consideration.</rdfs:comment>
    <cims:dataType rdf:resource="#ActivePower"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">maxFlow</rdfs:label>
    <cims:multiplicity rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/1999/rdf-schema-extensions-19990926#M:0..1"/>
    <cims:stereotype rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/NonStandard/UML#attribute"/>
    <cims:stereotype>NC</cims:stereotype>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint.positiveVirtualMargin">
    <rdfs:comment>A margin defined only for scanned AssessedElement (If AssessedElement.ScannedForRegion is present) in order to represent the influence of available remedial action which is not cross-border relevant remedial action.
The margin is modifying the limits used for the assessment whatever the limit it is (e.g. PATL, TATL).This symbolizes a remedial action that can be applied internally by the System Operator. It will be resolved by the System Operator and not by the optimization of remedial actions. The attribute shall be a positive value.
The allowed value range is [0,100].</rdfs:comment>
    <cims:dataType rdf:resource="#PerCent"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">positiveVirtualMargin</rdfs:label>
    <cims:multiplicity rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/1999/rdf-schema-extensions-19990926#M:0..1"/>
    <cims:stereotype rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/NonStandard/UML#attribute"/>
    <cims:stereotype>NC</cims:stereotype>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint.scannedThresholdMargin">
    <rdfs:comment>Threshold percentage that a scanned element can be overloaded, on a given element, on top of any overload prior to optimisation (default= 5%). e.g. Initial loading of the element is 110%, with a 5% scanned threshold margin, the new maximum is 115% of the limit (e.g. PATL, TATL, etc).
The allowed value range is [0,100].</rdfs:comment>
    <cims:dataType rdf:resource="#PerCent"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementRegularTimePoint"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">scannedThresholdMargin</rdfs:label>
    <cims:multiplicity rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/1999/rdf-schema-extensions-19990926#M:0..1"/>
    <cims:stereotype rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/NonStandard/UML#attribute"/>
    <cims:stereotype>NC</cims:stereotype>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cim4.eu/ns/nc#AssessedElementSchedule.AssessedElement">
